On Sun, 17 Jan 1999, Iraj Daizadeh wrote:

> Simple question: what is this error from finger:
> 
> % finger
> finger: /dev//tty??: No such file or directory
> Login     Name           Tty  Idle  Login Time   Office     Office Phone

It means the person you fingered is trying to use the new glibc-2.1 with
UNIX'98 pty support.  Unfortunately, finger/who/users/last/etc are all
broken by the new library and nobody has bothered fixing them yet.  This is
not Alpha-related, AFAIK.

