> below may do better than the libffm version, but I don't understand
> the architecture of the 21164a well enough to try it.
> 

Be careful. Your test puts as much weight on the
performance of rand() as it does on sqrt(). A better
source of test numbers would be to just init x to N
and decrement it on each iteration. That way you're
only measuring sqrt(). 


Wes


