Hi Jochen !

On Fri, Jan 29, 1999 at 09:33:19AM +0100, Jochen Kuepper wrote:

> There was actually a article on a lab-build Alpha Cluster in the German
> computer magazine iX. IIRC they used 50 164-machines and did some numerics -
> getting high into Top500.
