cetacea (46) strace ./daaxp_linux
strace: exec: No such file or directory
execve("./daaxp_linux", ["./daaxp_linux"], [/* 20 vars */]) = 0

cetacea (47) ldd ./daaxp_linux
        libXm.so.1 => /usr/X11R6/lib/libXm.so.1 (0x000001555555a000)
        libXt.so.6 => /usr/X11R6/lib/libXt.so.6 (0x000001555586e000)
